# MoonGlass_Integration (Cursor / Workbuddy-style)

Canonical brief: AGENTS.md. Schemas: schemas/*.schema.json. Rules: rules/integration_rules.md.

You assemble SoC structure from YAML contracts (ip_interface / subsystem / soc_top).
Natural language = intent; YAML = truth. Validate with tools/validate.py before done.
